<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Treasury raises 10 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Treasury raises 10 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it sold 10 million dinars of two-year notes at its weekly auction on October 1st, repaying maturing paper totalling 23.3 million dinars.</p>
<p>The two-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at a 9.000 percent yield, unchanged from last week's rate.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 59 million dinars of two-, three-, four- and five-year notes at between 9.0 and 9.4375 percent.  ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
